# RapidAPI Configuration for Live Market Data
# 1. Sign up at https://rapidapi.com (Free)
# 2. Subscribe to "Yahoo Finance" or "Real-Time Finance Data" on RapidAPI
# 3. Copy your RapidAPI Key and paste below:

VITE_RAPIDAPI_KEY=
VITE_RAPIDAPI_HOST=yahoo-finance15.p.rapidapi.com
VITE_RAPIDAPI_URL=https://yahoo-finance15.p.rapidapi.com/api/v1/markets/stock/quotes
